{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:06 2026-11-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:06 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:06 2026-11-27 HKT</p><img alt=\"黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d76b31d18b5579712cdea78cb99fe4b9/2026-11/2026-11-27_00_02_16_0.png\"/><p>影響廣東沿岸的東北季候風正在緩和。而覆蓋該區的雲帶亦逐漸轉薄。</p><p>本港地區今日初時部分時間多雲。日間漸轉天晴，市區最高氣溫約25度，新界再高一兩度。吹輕微至和緩北至東北風。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af54e3bdf233f1952b5d376b421785da/2026-11/2026-11-26_23_59_51.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d37aec1ebf7d157717b71aca1d18c9af/2026-11/2026-11-27_00_00_01.png\"/><p>展望週末期間至下週初大致天晴。星期六非常乾燥。星期日風勢頗大。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:43:57.314461+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T00:06:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T02:37:32.506232+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T00:37:29.565879+00:00","content_hash":"b7419c9f5fec6459a470ed97e39fed35c416573d879d3b15f5339b275890fcf7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}